{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20062","headline":"寄院中诸公 · 孟郊","name":"寄院中诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奕奕秋水傍，駸駸绿云蹄。\n月仙有高曜，灵凤无卑栖。\n翠色遶云谷，碧华凝月溪。\n竹林递历览，云寺行攀跻。\n冠豸独屈蠖，匣龙期剸犀。\n千山惊月晓，百里闻霜鼙。\n戎府多秀异，谢公期相携。\n因之仰羣彦，养拙固难齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}